flowchart TB
  UI[Next.js UI / FastAPI]
  subgraph Engine[WorkflowEngine · trusted local single instance]
    Planner[Planner]
    Policy[PolicyEngine · deterministic risk]
    Approval[Human Approval · version + SHA-256 snapshot]
    Executor[Executor · authorized intents / stable keys]
    Verifier[Verifier · deterministic ledger checks first]
    Semantic[Semantic reviewer · cannot override deterministic FAIL]
    Recovery[Recovery · reconcile / verification only]
    Planner --> Policy
    Policy -->|HIGH| Approval
    Policy -->|LOW / backend authorized| Executor
    Approval -->|approved exact snapshot| Executor
    Approval -->|rejected| Rejected[REJECTED · no transfer]
    Executor --> Verifier
    Verifier --> Semantic
    Semantic --> Result[COMPLETED / pending / bounded revision or failure]
    Recovery --> Verifier
  end
  UI --> Planner
  UI --> Approval
  UI --> Recovery
  Provider[Muse LLM Provider boundary]
  Fake[FakeLLMProvider · independently accepted M5.2]
  Live[MetaResponsesProvider · live evidence PENDING]
  Planner <-->|typed plan| Provider
  Semantic <-->|goal + plan + evidence| Provider
  Provider --> Fake
  Provider -.->|POST /responses · no invocation in M5.4| Live
  Corpus[Local policy corpus / evidence spans] --> Planner
  Executor -->|atomic synthetic transfer| Ledger[(SQLite Ledger)]
  Ledger -->|independent read| Verifier
  Ledger -->|existing operation| Recovery
  Store[(SQLite run / approval / audit tables)] <--> Engine
  Obs[Observability · audit payload hashes / workflow usage / evidence manifests / browser logs]
  Engine -.-> Obs
  Ledger -.-> Obs
